      "text": "Default model: gpt-6.1-sol\n\nResearch: question only, optional web_search\nLesson: question + previous lesson + research\n             + screenshot only when routed\nAction check: checkpoint + fresh screenshot\n\nReturns lesson JSON or action check result\nstore: false; timeouts; no automatic retries",
